ion","zh":"同意","fr":"être d'accord","ar":"يوافق","ko":"동의하다","ru":"соглашаться"}},{"word":"disagree","pos":"verb","meaning":{"ja":"反対する","en":"to have a different opinion","zh":"不同意","fr":"ne pas être d'accord","ar":"يعارض/لا يوافق","ko":"반대하다","ru":"не соглашаться"}},{"word":"support","pos":"verb","meaning":{"ja":"支える、根拠を示す","en":"to back up an idea, or hold something up","zh":"支持/支撑","fr":"soutenir","ar":"يدعم","ko":"지지하다/뒷받침하다","ru":"поддерживать"}},{"word":"express","pos":"verb","meaning":{"ja":"表現する","en":"to show a feeling or idea in words","zh":"表达","fr":"exprimer","ar":"يعبّر عن","ko":"표현하다","ru":"выражать"}},{"word":"communicate","pos":"verb","meaning":{"ja":"意思疎通する","en":"to share information or feelings with others","zh":"交流/沟通","fr":"communiquer","ar":"يتواصل","ko":"의사소통하다","ru":"общаться"}},{"word":"concentrate","pos":"verb","meaning":{"ja":"集中する","en":"to focus your attention on something","zh":"集中注意力","fr":"se concentrer","ar":"يركّز","ko":"집중하다","ru":"концентрироваться"}},{"word":"recognize","pos":"verb","meaning":{"ja":"見分ける、認識する","en":"to identify someone or something you've seen before","zh":"认出/识别","fr":"reconnaître","ar":"يتعرّف على","ko":"알아보다/인식하다","ru":"узнавать/распознавать"}},{"word":"remember","pos":"verb","meaning":{"ja":"覚えている","en":"to keep something in your memory","zh":"记得","fr":"se souvenir","ar":"يتذكر","ko":"기억하다","ru":"помнить"}},{"word":"forget","pos":"verb","meaning":{"ja":"忘れる","en":"to fail to remember","zh":"忘记","fr":"oublier","ar":"ينسى","ko":"잊다","ru":"забывать"}},{"word":"absent","pos":"adjective","meaning":{"ja":"欠席している","en":"not present","zh":"缺席的","fr":"absent(e)","ar":"غائب","ko":"결석한","ru":"отсутствующий"}},{"word":"present","pos":"adjective","meaning":{"ja":"出席している","en":"being there, attending","zh":"出席的","fr":"présent(e)","ar":"حاضر","ko":"출석한","ru":"присутствующий"}},{"word":"ready","pos":"adjective","meaning":{"ja":"準備ができている","en":"prepared for something","zh":"准备好的","fr":"prêt(e)","ar":"جاهز","ko":"준비된","ru":"г